PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48B3

   1 a 0000 E48B3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1 r2] THE MINIMAL STATIC CASE: one static bit, one
   4 a 0006      literal, no automatics, no stop.  If DR's DEF-DATA-SIZE is 2
   5 a 0006      the static cell is NOT part of bind's top section total; if
   6 a 0006      it is 3 my formula's shape is right and something else
   7 a 0006      charges the byte. */
